]}},{"id":"city-1159148593","name":"古达米斯","country":"LBY","lat":30.13329,"lon":9.50003,"kind":"city","region":"LY-GD","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"古达米斯 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"古达米斯，或称盖达米斯、加达梅斯（；，柏柏语：Ghdames / Ɣdames / ɛadēməs；: ġdāməs）是利比亚西部的一座绿洲城镇，坐落于的黎波里西南方549公里处，属纳卢特省管辖。\n古达米斯属于热带沙漠性气候（柯本气候分类法 BWh），夏季漫长而极度炎热，一年中平均最热的月份七月份，约为 41°C（105.8°F），冬季则短暂而温暖。\n该城镇全年降雨甚少，平均年降水量仅 33.1 毫米（1.30 英寸）。","culture":null,"see":"自2016年以来，它与利比亚的其他四个遗址一起被列入濒危世界遗产名录，原因是利比亚内战对该国造成的破坏及其造成的进一步破坏的威胁。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q192237","articleTitle":"古达米斯","sourceRevision":94498723,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 古达米斯","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A4%E8%BE%BE%E7%B1%B3%E6%96%AF"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94498723"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q192237"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148597","name":"胡恩","country":"LBY","lat":29.11666,"lon":15.93333,"kind":"city","region":"LY-JU","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"胡恩 · 地点概要","geo":"胡恩（，Hūn）是利比亚中部城市，朱夫拉省省会。\n北距苏尔特240公里，南距塞卜哈272公里。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1991249","articleTitle":"胡恩 (利比亚城市)","sourceRevision":89840370,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 胡恩 (利比亚城市)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%83%A1%E6%81%A9%20%28%E5%88%A9%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9A%E5%9F%8E%E5%B8%82%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89840370"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1991249"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-